1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
A speech delay at two years old.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,930
An autism diagnosis at thirty.

3
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:09,330
An epilepsy that appears out of nowhere.

4
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:14,480
Different stories, but the search that begins afterwards is the same:

5
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:20,520
a specialist here, a therapy there, a place that might welcome you properly.

6
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:24,800
And a lot of time lost along the way.

7
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:31,350
Neuromundi is the network that connects families, patients and people

8
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:36,900
with specialists, shops and inclusive schools, validated by the community.

9
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:41,910
And it doesn't cover one reality, but three:

10
00:00:41,910 --> 00:00:44,540
neurodevelopment, neurodivergence and neurological conditions.

11
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:52,220
The child in follow-up, the neurodivergent adult and the neurological patient are looking for different things.

12
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:57,600
Until now they had to look for them in different places.

13
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:05,480
In the directory you find who to turn to, filtered by area, speciality and location.

14
00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:08,870
Every profile is a real, verifiable profile,

15
00:01:08,870 --> 00:01:14,000
backed by the ratings of those who have already been there.

16
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:19,690
And when you find them, you book right there.

17
00:01:19,690 --> 00:01:23,900
No chains of messages, no calls nobody answers.

18
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:29,370
In the store you find materials, products and resources

19
00:01:29,370 --> 00:01:34,300
made for these three realities, not half-adapted from something else.

20
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:39,970
In the Academy, learning for every profile and every area:

21
00:01:39,970 --> 00:01:47,690
for the family just starting out, for the adult who has just put a name to it,

22
00:01:47,690 --> 00:01:54,100
for the teacher who needs tools, for the specialist who wants to keep up.

23
00:01:55,100 --> 00:02:00,400
And in Inclusion, schools, shops and companies that really are prepared.

24
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:06,600
For the child starting first grade, and for the adult looking for work

25
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:11,450
or for a place where they will be received well.

26
00:02:11,450 --> 00:02:15,400
Knowing that in advance is a service too.

27
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:22,070
Neuromundi brings together in one place what today is scattered across dozens:

28
00:02:22,070 --> 00:02:26,410
a validated directory, appointments, a store, learning and inclusion.

29
00:02:26,410 --> 00:02:32,530
And it does it for all three areas at once, in eleven languages,

30
00:02:32,530 --> 00:02:35,980
Arabic and Hebrew included, with right-to-left reading.

31
00:02:35,980 --> 00:02:42,100
We have not found any other network in the world that does this.

32
00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:47,740
For families, patients and people, signing up is free.

33
00:02:47,740 --> 00:02:50,960
For specialists, shops, schools and companies,

34
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:57,030
it is how they get found by the people who need them.

35
00:02:57,030 --> 00:03:00,240
Neuromundi: the shared home of neurodevelopment,

36
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:02,500
neurodivergence and neurological conditions.
